Max,

Thank you for the note, and thank you Curtis for looping me in.

For the written record, the operative document on presentation deadlines is the tentative map approval letter for TM-22-500041 dated 03/14/2022, which quotes the applicable language from NRS 278.360 verbatim and directs the applicant to compute its own presentation deadlines from the operative events identified in the statute. Informal communications from staff are not extensions and cannot modify a statutory clock.

Before I route a formal reply from this Department, please confirm in writing the recordation date of the first final map recorded in this series (Phases 1 and 2), together with the recording reference. Once I have that, I will respond on Department letterhead so you have something you can file.

I would also recommend that any request touching an extension be routed as a written application in the manner described in the approval letter rather than resolved by email.

Regards,

