Quick answer, no need to make it complicated. TMs in Clark County run four years from approval under NRS 278.360. Yours (TM-22-500041) was approved 03/14/2022, so you were up on 03/14/2026. I don't show a formal extension on file for TM-22-500041, but I'd loop in Odette on the actual mechanics - she owns the file and the paper trail on that side.

Good luck with the resubmittal, hope the landscape comments aren't too painful.

